<title>USA: New York physical copper market - May 19.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - May 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for May shipment were quoted at a nominal 119.25 to 119.50 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 97.00 cents, up 1.00 cent from May 16th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
